{"generated": "2026-08-10 19:23", "brief": "<b>1. 메리츠증권의 대형 딜 참여 및 역량 강화</b>\n메리츠증권은 2.5조 원 규모의 포스코 PRS(주식리턴스왑) 거래에 깜짝 등장하며 시장의 주목을 받았습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQTS04djVSRG54azFaQTZZVnViZlRWcG91eC1tMDZJUVBWSzdMdFIwbmVPVlpPZF9naGE2OWtDUnZaSDZHSlpNZy04bWlYcmpSN2k4cS16d1JJNGhtZ2pFZGc1OEJGdElpRGR4SHZlWEdUdjJjMnQ0elRGdEp2RGxJMWZkSE0tVWZkaXAw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#12</a>]. 이와 함께 기획재정부의 세계국채지수(WGBI) 편입에 기여한 인재를 영입하며 대외 금융 역량을 한층 강화하고 나섰습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPNmxsZG1WdXMtYTd3X0UzMHZkbzNHNVkwYXFJanYyZmdGTnlwVDVmNzdmT0RTUm5EaktvejZvUGVtVVpEMGdIbkhfREVnRjRxaDA1OVpKRlNybEhtdk4ySjg1NU94dGtEbTlwWmVCSHhZRUx1VDBMYVhBTkR1T2oyQ3NQaHNLOHpodk9v?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a>].\n\n<b>2. 우리투자증권의 스팩 기반 IPO 시장 본격 진입</b>\n출범 이후 본격적인 트랙레코드 쌓기에 나선 우리투자증권이 스팩(SPAC)을 활용해 기업공개(IPO) 시장에서의 첫 실적을 채우기 시작했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQNEN5OHliX3pXamtPVlViTks1ZjJvMk83RG5kV0FmQTZrbzAwMVItNkxtNVV1b2FFM2ZDR21VR3drSG9NSEFZQ0QzbjZnSkJlNW5IRm4zd2VaZDBLUlVpbWhZQ0dQbWszMVNBNGFHYjJSQ3lINjJJVzcyZFFPMTJUZ3paTDd0MG1xNE1F?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#3</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5oWFg3VGlBaVZqc3pQbDlZbWNSN0hoTFRBRU4zcTBSZlhXbG5IeE1GeHNMQnZ3RkZsckI5QV9mR1hOWkIyT1Z4ay10anhJVUwzY0kybzVDOTN6SGlQNlZHMmpzbWFldjg3Nmc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a>]. 이는 향후 대형 IPO 딜 수주를 위한 본격적인 기반 다지기로 해석됩니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQNEN5OHliX3pXamtPVlViTks1ZjJvMk83RG5kV0FmQTZrbzAwMVItNkxtNVV1b2FFM2ZDR21VR3drSG9NSEFZQ0QzbjZnSkJlNW5IRm4zd2VaZDBLUlVpbWhZQ0dQbWszMVNBNGFHYjJSQ3lINjJJVzcyZFFPMTJUZ3paTDd0MG1xNE1F?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#3</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5oWFg3VGlBaVZqc3pQbDlZbWNSN0hoTFRBRU4zcTBSZlhXbG5IeE1GeHNMQnZ3RkZsckI5QV9mR1hOWkIyT1Z4ay10anhJVUwzY0kybzVDOTN6SGlQNlZHMmpzbWFldjg3Nmc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a>].\n\n<b>3. 전력기기 및 방산 분야 M&amp;A 열기 고조</b>\n우진기전이 몸값 3,000억 원 수준으로 평가받으며 전력기기 분야의 M&amp;A 시장을 뜨겁게 달구고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9hZlBIZWt2ZU0zd2gybnFlZHZzMnhQaV81RmNvY1d6cDI2VWg1SUR4WVNYRjFSdHRGNFR3cHkxNzNHRktwMDhVRUF5VDRid2hfT2E0?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a>]. 한편 한화는 한국항공우주산업(KAI) 지분을 15% 이상 확보하며 우주·방산 시너지를 겨냥한 M&amp;A 포석을 마련했다는 분석이 나옵니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE9raXlMWjU4NDdxdnVfSUFqNHo1NlpITENXUDJmWXhrM1otR2kzSHFxLWFWR2ZmVV9xRWtORGJHSzNoM3dQNndORmxUSE01a01LeDRwTzhveS0wNGFsSUhKdjNKVE4?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a>].\n\n<b>4. 자본시장 내 전환사채 발행 및 조기상환 동향</b>\n에이프로젠이 채무상환을 목적으로 500억 원 규모의 전환사채(CB) 발행을 결정한 반면, 상아프론테크는 투자자의 풋옵션 행사에 따라 181억 원 규모의 CB를 만기 전에 조기 취득했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE9scEloV19jbjRpd3BsNlBwOTZQd2wwa21iZnpEQTRSSEt4d2JEUnotbkQ4Q2dPaHI5MkVQb3Blb2dqWFpIaDF0Z3FFSDFrSEtiak9IcmtacVNVTmQ4MFNVNHE4RTcxWERG?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5RTklZSHJ6NkIwbW51ZU55X21ndFM4T18wTjhOazI2bUtPT1BIVkVBRTV1ajdHSmU2NDByblY2UDdQbVhUdW8tRkYyXzF4bUhRWnpORzVib1NkM24zX0thNUVnekpzZzhmVEtTUjFqS1p4emc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a>].", "brief_at": "2026-08-10 19:23", "premium": [{"t": "08-10 10:16", "title": "[News Briefing] 한화·LIG 손잡고 'AI 軍참모' 만든다", "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPZlZHZ3YtcE1zZzNHYkk5WG45bWM2aXRkSlJ5WmMzWTF3b2VhWHM4VjI4MkZ2MUN6UWJRQ1BHYWNGSWE1OFlWZk5teVdsY0tmZ1ZRb0JfZmxmY08wTkRzU0pPUUNvd3k0em1weEVfbmdIODl5cHZ2aXlZcE9XS0k2a2R5MkktaTNQZGs4?oc=5", "src": "더벨(thebell) · M&A/자본시장"}, {"t": "08-10 10:16", "title": "주요 공시(14:00~17:00)", "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQQjZteFpFa2N5Mng5dEJDaXJIVm5YZVF3ZnpkVUZwVWU5NVloYWN2bGdkUklzR3hXcXdWRzZFZUtoWlNVaU5yYnRwTVBZbVpZTHhldHlpR0poWUY4bXFuU29rUnMwSWlBMFhjdXlibG41dzBUQU9PcFNvSjY1djFLdkFZS1hKSlVUWlZ